{"data": [{"author_id": "29472803", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116594806554018121"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 79, "id": "14091091", "start": 68, "username": "NASAHubble"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZjFcp70nMx", "end": 288, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASAWebb/status/2116594806554018121/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116400210981036032", "start": 265, "url": "https://t.co/ZjFcp70nMx"}]}, "id": "2116594806554018121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 83501, "like_count": 1124, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 159}, "text": "Happy Halloween! 👻\n\nLike a spectral form rising out of a cold mist, @NASAHubble and Webb have captured a hauntingly dynamic star-forming scene, which lies within the vast Carina Nebula, a diffuse star-forming region located about 7,500 light-years away from Earth. https://t.co/ZjFcp70nMx", "url": "https://x.com/NASAWebb/status/2116594806554018121"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:49:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116588280334749821"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 186, "id": "15862891", "start": 179, "username": "Nature"}], "urls": [{"description": "Nature - A multi-ancestry study of Alzheimer’s disease identifies new risk loci and potential drug targets, implicates microglia and neurons, and reveals a larger common-variant contribution...", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/s4158…", "end": 210, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11206-y", "images": [{"height": 2392, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115485555353948160/xKdzWa5P?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1785}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115485555353948160/xKdzWa5P?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 187, "status": 200, "title": "Alzheimer’s disease genetics converges on microglial and neuronal dysregulation", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11206-y?error=cookies_not_supported&code=f9445a7b-5596-4f72-af43-bac53e79411b", "url": "https://t.co/yd3D6E4DbK"}]}, "id": "2116588280334749821", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 139, "impression_count": 30328, "like_count": 329, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 73}, "text": "Discovery of 48 new, common genomic loci (a ~60% jump) associated with Alzheimer's disease. A high proportion of the new loci are tagged to brain immune cell (microglia) function @Nature\nhttps://t.co/yd3D6E4DbK", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2116588280334749821"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:22:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116581469724254245"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Research is revealing the cellular mechanisms that link mental well-being and longevity.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/3W1JQfr", "end": 89, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/3W1JQfr", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116581474925195265/2kEWRDl6?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116581474925195265/2kEWRDl6?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 66, "status": 200, "title": "How your brain controls ageing — and why zombie cells could be key", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-01886-3?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64276646&error=cookies_not_supported&code=e91469fc-9c4f-42cd-9edb-5e663892147f", "url": "https://t.co/u6GBykDb2x"}]}, "id": "2116581469724254245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 21625, "like_count": 130, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "Zombie cells could be the key to how your brain controls ageing \n\nhttps://t.co/u6GBykDb2x", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2116581469724254245"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:00:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116576032878973421"], "