📚 Rise of the planet of the zombie bugs\n\nhttps://t.co/AfHA6IeQKh", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2116550764722041134"}, {"author_id": "10666172", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:13:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116549037864128678"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/WlU8AOGVKM", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/skdh/status/2116549037864128678/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116546879022346240", "start": 86, "url": "https://t.co/WlU8AOGVKM"}]}, "id": "2116549037864128678", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4026, "impression_count": 4815667, "like_count": 8916, "quote_count": 151, "reply_count": 776, "retweet_count": 736}, "text": "The dinosaurs probably died much faster -- and much more horribly -- than we thought. https://t.co/WlU8AOGVKM", "url": "https://x.com/skdh/status/2116549037864128678"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:10:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116533180366766146"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 77, "start": 67, "tag": "Halloween"}], "mentions": [{"end": 122, "id": "2326120952", "start": 106, "username": "ScienceAdvances"}], "urls": [{"description": "The combination of spider silk genotype-phenotype data revealed essential amino acid motifs contributing to physical properties.", "display_url": "scim.ag/4ziIQSx", "end": 259, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4ziIQSx", "images": [{"height": 615, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116533190139453441/Rofhq1qe?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 788}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116533190139453441/Rofhq1qe?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 236, "status": 200, "title": "1000 spider silkomes: Linking sequences to silk physical properties", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciadv.abo6043?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=ownedSocial", "url": "https://t.co/vl5nzToSve"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/GgKKCFegRY", "end": 283, "expanded_url": "https://x.co