_count": 25, "impression_count": 17372, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "Lurking throughout your body, from your liver to your brain, are zombie-like entities\n\nhttps://t.co/F06Nk5vJCq", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2116526859299037326"}, {"author_id": "10666172", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:12:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116503518487961614"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "General Relativity intrinsically predicts its own breakdown at the Big Bang singularity. Read the full paper in The Astrophysical Journal.", "display_url": "iopscienceiop.org", "end": 192, "expanded_url": "https://iopscienceiop.org", "images": [{"height": 100, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116479896935702528/MN-xsAkH?format=png&name=orig", "width": 890}, {"height": 100, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116479896935702528/MN-xsAkH?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 100}], "start": 169, "status": 200, "title": "From Infinite Dimensions to Black Hole Universes: Refuting the Big Bang Theory", "unwound_url": "https://iopscienceiop.org", "url": "https://t.co/A6v8zFKctl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/vrslPQgJl8", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/skdh/status/2116503518487961614/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116503496979595265", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/vrslPQgJl8"}]}, "id": "2116503518487961614", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 29173, "like_count": 236, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "presumably the first author of the paper has set up an entire fake domain to make their \"big bang refutation\" appear as if it was published in a peer reviewed journal  (https://t.co/A6v8zFKctl). hoping to fool who or what I wonder? https://t.co/vrslPQgJl8", "url": "https://x.com/skdh/status/2116503518487961614"}, {"author_id": "207256884", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:09:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116502729787138095"], "entities": {"me